{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0424_1006_p", "source_sha256": "d722df5e66a401bd72877bdb32840810a89becc24d7520247c7e6cd205647c4e", "ja": "衣装には、キャラクター性も現れるもんな。\nうん、役柄のイメージ通りで、よく似合ってるよ。", "zh": "服装确实能体现出角色的个性。\n嗯，和角色的形象完全吻合，非常适合你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0424_1007_030iku", "source_sha256": "90aa2870d1b3d90f6ad008090501be4cfbc1d41359bd2a7fbbef33381a5ef3fe", "ja": "わーい！　{$P$}さんにも\nほめてもらっちゃった♪", "zh": "哇—！也被{$P$}先生夸奖了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
