{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0424_1009_030iku", "source_sha256": "f2d57fc5657d16d9ca063435641db1ce3d87c59c8e1e41a6bcaa8456e7a16b63", "ja": "あのね、{$P$}さんが来る前、\nここに瑞希さんもいたんだ！", "zh": "那个，{$P$}先生来之前，瑞希姐姐也在这里呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0424_1010_030iku", "source_sha256": "11c96d54c684cf2f50556a83a99108f378d4666b19f57fadf606f5e8e2a96ca1", "ja": "それで衣装を見せたら「中谷さんによくお似合いで、\nとてもキュートです」ってほめてくれたんだよ♪", "zh": "然后我给她看了演出服，她还夸我说：“中谷小姐穿着很合适，非常可爱呢。”♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0424_1011_p", "source_sha256": "1b9137581eccd6e4343cdc2bb0ee92fc57a987e8dd7707f6932771421df3a03c", "ja": "はは、そうだったんだな。そういえば最近、\n瑞希とよく一緒にいるような気がするけど……。", "zh": "哈哈，原来是这样啊。说起来，我最近总觉得你经常和瑞希待在一起……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0424_1012_030iku", "source_sha256": "ca51188d42c03e01ae7b4f02be01353181e69a8c780448446ced01ca7d04ba85", "ja": "うん！　わたし、今回の映画で、\n瑞希さんの妹みたいな女の子の役でしょ？", "zh": "嗯！我这次在电影里，演的是像瑞希姐姐妹妹一样的女孩子，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0424_1013_030iku", "source_sha256": "4f416f5a55d8af446d6b9a48e36182c748a19311811f8cda233d42a7ff2e88e7", "ja": "だからレッスンでも、いっしょになることが多くて。\nそれでいっぱい、話すようになったんだ！", "zh": "所以就算在排练时，我们也经常一起练习。\n然后就聊了很多，关系也变得更好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0424_1014_p", "source_sha256": "56ee2e9a5af8e7446c0b53169a944bcf767310f7736197c4ae7b7e46c5c2a4ab", "ja": "そうか。それで、よく2人でいたんだな。", "zh": "这样啊。所以，你们经常是2个人在一起啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0424_1015_030iku", "source_sha256": "e6febcd998051d42e9a7d959b7188d4e0c53ebc1a722be7c1e8345a34da46ef7", "ja": "そうなの。瑞希さん、優しいんだよ！\nいつもわたしのこと、心配してくれて……。", "zh": "是呀。瑞希姐姐人很温柔的！\n她总是很担心我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0424_1016_030iku", "source_sha256": "6c500a1f5d9ad7bb56c10af35029591f193488344af1d97a06a7c04c9fa4288d", "ja": "失敗しちゃったときも、優しくなぐさめてくれて、\nほんとうのお姉ちゃんみたいだなぁって♪", "zh": "搞砸的时候也会温柔地安慰我，\n感觉就像亲姐姐一样呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0424_1017_p", "source_sha256": "d8804449cf6425a1f3d108dc478be8deb6ff34e53ed304a51d0180d509fb7741", "ja": "おお、もう関係性はバッチリって感じだな。\n撮影に入るのが、今から楽しみだ！", "zh": "哇，感觉你们已经相处得非常好了。现在就很期待开始拍摄了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
